    "标题": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "美股ETF：SPY日线；EMA(30)>EMA(60)×(1+0.001)时空仓止损限价买100（止损=高×1.10、限价=高×1.11）；成交后趋势转弱则止损限价卖100（止损=低×0.99、限价=低×0.98）（Lean StopLimitOrderRegression）"
    },
    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 Lean `StopLimitOrderRegressionAlgorithm.py`。`add_equity(\"SPY\",Daily)`；`ema` 快30/慢60；容差 `tolerance=0.001`。就绪后：无买单且 `fast > slow*(1+tolerance)` → `stop_limit_order(+100, stop=high*1.10, limit=high*1.11)`；买单 FILLED 且无卖单且 `fast < slow*(1+tolerance)` → `stop_limit_order(−100, stop=low*0.99, limit=low*0.98)`。断言成交价须落在限价一侧且 `stop_triggered`。不是仅市价 EMA 交叉满仓核，也不是 SecurityCustomProperties 分钟 EMA30/60 市价核。提出日期未知。SPY日线EMA30/60容差0.001止损限价±100 ≠ 加密EMA30/60市价核 / SecurityCustomProperties分钟市价核。计入美股/ETF。提出日期按源文件原样保留未知。"
    },
